OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin with
OL,6,Fmist or freezing fog patches, these
OL,7,Fwill be slow to clear. Most places
OL,8,Fwill stay dry throughout the day with
OL,9,Fbright or sunny spells increasing once
OL,10,Fany fog clears.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowery rain at times along
OL,13,Fthe east coast otherwise mostly dry
OL,14,Fwith clear spells and light winds
OL,15,Fleading to some mist or freezing fog
OL,16,Fpatches.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FEarly cloud and showery
OL,19,Frain along the east coast will soon
OL,20,Fclear to leave the day dry and bright
OL,21,Fwith sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
