OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fand cold with bright or sunny spells
OL,7,FThursday, less cold with increasing
OL,8,Fcloud Friday and Saturday becoming
OL,9,Fbreezy with increasing outbreaks of
OL,10,Fshowery rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
